==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|obez|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|obaz||fruit|lang=goh}}, from {{proto|Germanic|obatjan|produce, increase|lang=de}}. Cognate with {{etyl|ang|-}} {{term|ofett||fruit, vegetable, legume|lang=ang}}, {{etyl|gml|-}} and {{etyl|dum|-}} {{term|ovet||fruit|tr={{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|ooft|lang=nl}}|lang=gml}}.

===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|lang=de|/ʔoːpst/}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|g=n|gen1=Obsts|gen2=Obstes|pl=-}}

# [[fruit]]
#: ''Heute esse ich nur '''Obst'''.'' - Today I only eat fruit.

